sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant DS as Document Service
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant BC as Blockchain
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant VO as Verifying Organization

    U->>F: Upload Document
    F->>DS: Submit Document
    DS->>AI: Pre-screen Document
    AI-->>DS: Pre-screening Results
    
    alt Pre-screening Passed
        DS->>BC: Store Document Hash
        BC-->>DS: Transaction Confirmed
        DS->>VO: Request Verification
        DS->>NS: Create Notification
        NS-->>U: Notify Document Received
        
        VO->>DS: Review Document
        
        alt Document Approved
            DS->>BC: Update Verification Status
            BC-->>DS: Transaction Confirmed
            DS->>NS: Create Notification
            NS-->>U: Notify Verification Complete
        else Document Rejected
            DS->>NS: Create Notification
            NS-->>U: Notify Rejection with Reason
        end
    else Pre-screening Failed
        DS->>NS: Create Notification
        NS-->>U: Notify Pre-screening Failed
    end
